// Module legacycsp checks that the ballots the saas-backend CSP signs for questions published on
// the legacy CSP census origins verify with the vochain-sequencer verifier of those origins. It is a
// module of its own so that neither the production module nor the voconed build of test/sequencer
// share a dependency graph with the other.
module github.com/vocdoni/saas-backend/test/sequencer/legacycsp

go 1.26.5

replace github.com/vocdoni/saas-backend => ../../..

